                                           [:seon.error/operation]]
                       :description "A fault no resolution closes: its producer has not changed since its latest occurrence and nobody resolved it. Its subject is the producer (the blame rule), which its task's must-reads name; the operation that observed it is a clue, and a fault no authored definition produced has no subject."}
